{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Undertale Connection\n\nParallel universe confirmed by Toby Fox. Shares characters and several lore threads.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Gaster**\nOriginal UT character, missing in both games.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Asriel**\nSame character, different story.","x":320,"y":164,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nSOULs and the Vessel theory share mechanics with UT.","x":-580,"y":164,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Undertale.png","x":-960,"y":-207,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":-129,"y":-938,"width":74,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel.png","x":669,"y":306,"width":99,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-920,"y":303,"width":81,"height":158},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":320,"y":-390,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"**Is Sans a traveler from Deltarune?**\nThe note's strongest theory: the Ch.5 punch card (\"Don't Forget\") is practically identical to the one already hidden in his secret workshop in Undertale since 2015 — the same object in both games. He's also the only Lightner whose design hasn't changed at all from Undertale, and the only one who freely uses magic outside the Dark Worlds."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","x":700,"y":-420,"width":190,"height":152,"file":"Sprites/sans_dont_forget.png"},{"id":"s3b-img","type":"file","x":700,"y":-220,"width":190,"height":152,"file":"Sprites/sans_lab_dont_forget.png"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":-580,"y":-390,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**Papyrus**\nNever appears on screen in either game — his total absence from Deltarune (against Sans's strong presence here) fuels much of the theorizing about where he actually went. [[Papyrus]]"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","x":-880,"y":-420,"width":150,"height":200,"file":"Sprites/papyrus_shadow.png"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":-580,"y":-130,"width":260,"height":170,"color":"1","text":"**Is Undertale the result of a Weird Route?**\nA highly speculative reading: Undertale's own sealed world would be the consequence of a Deltarune Weird Route taken all the way through — the Prophecy's \"Angel's Heaven\" and the human-monster war could be the same catastrophe seen from two angles."},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":-580,"y":70,"width":260,"height":170,"color":"1","text":"**A hidden prequel, not a parallel universe?**\nMinority reading: Hometown \"wears the face\" of Undertale but without the war or the Underground — the same world before those events, not a parallel timeline. This clashes with the fact that Toby Fox has already described the relationship as parallel universes."},{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":320,"y":380,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**Player**\nThe Vessel creation sequence in the intro directly reuses terminology, aesthetics, and music associated with Gaster in Undertale. [[Jugador]]"},{"id":"s8","type":"text","x":-900,"y":70,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"**Angel**\nThe \"Angel's Heaven\" that must be banished according to the Prophecy could be the same catastrophe as Undertale's human-monster war, read from the other side. [[Ángel]]"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s3img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s3bimg","fromNode":"s3b-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_sans_card","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_papyrus_sans","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_rutarara_angel","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_jugador_gaster","fromNode":"s7","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_precuela_rutarara","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}